{"id":"n44177-4-11","stage":4,"title":"담담하다 · (味道)清淡","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44177-4-11-1","ko":"간이 어때요?","zh":"味道怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"간이","meaning":"咸淡","explanation":"간：咸淡；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16203","senseId":"2","lemma":"간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"74ca8db3a8d70490","term":"간","zh":"咸淡","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3","entryId":"16203","definition":"食物咸的程度。","pronunciation":["간"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e39aaa19d7db35111fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44177-4-11-2","ko":"조금 담담한 것이 딱 좋아요.","zh":"稍微清淡一点的正好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담담한","meaning":"(味道)清淡","explanation":"담담하다：(味道)清淡；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"담담하다","audio":"/audio/9c6bee4dca73faaeb6fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44177","senseId":"4","lemma":"담담하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딱","meaning":"正好，正","explanation":"딱：正好，正","readings":